/** \example test_tpetra_stratimikos_solver.cpp

The bottom of this page shows a simple test program for how the
<tt>Stratimikos::DefaultLinearSolverBuilder</tt> class is used to take a
parameter list (e.g. read from a file) and use it to build
<tt>Thyra::LinearOpWithSolveFactory</tt> and
<tt>Thyra::PreconditionerFactoryBase</tt> objects.

The testing program is driven by
<tt>test_tpetra_stratimikos_solver_driver.cpp</tt> and uses
<tt>FourByFour.belos.np.xml</tt>. The separate <tt>test_tpetra_belos.cpp</tt>
program uses <tt>TpetraBelosTest.xml</tt> and
<tt>stratimikos_BelosPrec_ParameterList.xml</tt>.

